library "Neg Exclusion Policy".
concept "Indication Leaf":
- type is Observation.
- value type is boolean.
- code is `indication-leaf`.
concept "Contra Leaf":
- type is Observation.
- value type is boolean.
- code is `contra-leaf`.
concept "Indication Present":
- value type is boolean.
- defined as ( "Indication Leaf" ).
concept "Has Contraindication":
- value type is boolean.
- defined as ( "Contra Leaf" ).
activity "Approve":
- request CPGServiceRequest.
activity "Deny":
- request CPGServiceRequest.
decision "Coverage":
first:
- when ( "Indication Present" and not "Has Contraindication" ) then recommend activity "Approve".
- otherwise then recommend activity "Deny".
